- @page_title = "About Nitrous"
= render 'page_menu'

.container
  .page-title
    %h2= @page_title
    %h4 Nitrous is a cloud application platform that helps you create and configure the infrastructure and services for complex web applications in just seconds.

  %h3 Nitrous Boxes

  %figure
    = image_tag 'boxes-recent.png'

  %p Boxes are the foundation of the Nitrous platform.  Boxes are made up of any combination of web application services, including programming languages, databases, key-value stores, utilities, frameworks and more.  We recommend that each application is run in isolation on its own box.

  %h3 Autoparts: Managed Services
  %figure
    = image_tag 'autoparts.png'

  %p
    %a{ href: 'https://github.com/nitrous-io/autoparts' } Autoparts
    is our open-source package manager built specifically for Nitrous boxes.  We have support for over 50+ packages and are adding more frequently.  Popular frameworks, languages, databases, and other utilities can be installed on your box with just one click.

  %h3 Our Investors
  :markdown
    We have received investment from [Bessemer Venture Partners](http://www.bvp.com/), [CrunchFund](http://www.crunchbase.com/financial-organization/crunchfund), [500 Startups](http://500.co/), [Draper Associates](http://www.drapervc.com/), [TIBCO Software](http://www.tibco.com/), [GoldenGate Ventures](http://goldengate.vc/), [Eduardo Saverin](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eduardo_Saverin), and [Prosper Nwankpa](https://angel.co/prospern).

  %h3 Our Advisors
  :markdown
    We are advised by [Shopify](http://www.shopify.com/) CEO [Tobi Lutke](https://twitter.com/tobi), [Sprint.ly](https://sprint.ly/) Co-founder [Joe Stump](https://twitter.com/joestump), and [Parse](https://parse.com/) Co-founder [James Yu](https://twitter.com/jamesjyu).
